title: Faust0Start
---
You pass by a door, but stop at the sound of shouts from
inside. You peer in, seeing a crowd, mostly men, cheering on a
fight. A loud round of cheers erupts as a guy in the middle
raises his fist in triumph. He basks in the crowd's admiration,
and you find yourself staring.

When the next match starts, you find the same guy again. He is
still in his wrestling attire, a towel over his shoulders as he
rests.

He notices you and turns, his eyes lighting up.

Faust: "Hello! Are you a member here?"

His voice is bubbly. He looks at what you're wearing and seems
confused.

-> Say You're a Fan
    <<incRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump AFan>>

-> Tell The Truth
    <<jump TellTruth>>

-> Lie
    <<decRelationship "Faust" 1>>
