===

title: AFan
---
You look at him and make a quick decision.

You: "I'm sorry. I'm just such a big fan of you. I had to talk
to you. You did so well today."

You smile, and his grin widens instantly.

His eyes light up as he basks in your praise. Ah...one of those
people.

<<jump MyNameIs>>
===

title: TellTruth
---
You: "I need your help with something,"

You decide to be honest. His posture relaxes and his energy
drops.

Faust: "Oh? You need my help? Why?"

His voice deflates like a balloon. He seems disappointed.

<<jump MyNameIs>>
===

title: LieNode
---
You: "Oh yeah I'm in the club too,"

The lie escapes before you can think. You stand there awkwardly.

He furrows his brows, looking you up and down repeatedly. You
feel self conscious under his gaze.

Faust: "Yeah...I don't believe you. Why are you really here?"

You sigh. Lying was a bad idea.

<<jump MyNameIs>>
===

title: MyNameIs
---
You: "Hi, my name is {$playerName}. I need volunteers for my
last essay in Philosophy, and I was wondering if you'd be
interested in being one,"

His expression shifts from curiosity to realization.

Faust: "Of course! I'd love to help you. I'm Faust. Let's
discuss the details,"

He radiates energy and kindness as he smiles.

Before you can reply, voices grow louder. A group of girls push
through the room, clearly looking for someone.

His demeanor brightens as if he forgot you were there. He
straightens and starts walking toward them.

-> 
    <<incRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump LetHimGo>>

-> 
    <<jump TugHisShirt>>

-> 
    <<decRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump SayExcuseMe>>
===

title: LetHimGo
---
You watch him walk away, hands twitching at your sides. You
want to stop him, but seeing him so happy makes you hesitate.

Faust: "The match was challenging! Thank you for asking,"

He beams warmly, filling the room with energy.

The girls giggle, asking questions and offering gifts. He
accepts them politely but does not dwell on them.

After a few minutes, the crowd disperses. Faust glances back
absently and notices you.

Faust: "Oh...sorry about that,"

You nod, looking away awkwardly.

You: "It's fine...,"

You lead him to a quieter part of the room.

<<jump SoDoYou>>
===

title: TugHisShirt
---
You panic as he walks away. Acting on impulse, you rush forward
and grab his shirt.

You: "Wait! We still need to talk!"

He startles, as if he forgot you were there. He turns to you,
something dark flashing in his eyes before he forces a smile.

Faust: "Oh! Apologies, let's go,"

He glances at the crowd reluctantly before following you to a
quiet corner.

<<jump SoDoYou>>
===

title: SayExcuseMe
---
You frown, watching him walk away. The audacity irritates you.

You: "Uh...Excuse me?"

He turns, his excitement fading when he sees your expression.

Faust: "Ahh...apologies. I got ahead of myself,"

He turns away from the crowd and focuses on you.

You both move to a quieter part of the room.

<<jump SoDoYou>>
===

title: SoDoYou
---
You nod, smiling slightly. At least he now understands the
importance of your questions.

